{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000020729","bookName":"Cuando el Amor es una Apuesta Perdida (Doblado)","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000020729/42000020729.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":5354999,"followCount":126101,"introduction":"Cinco años luego de haberse casado con Iris López por dinero, el primer amor de ella, Omar, regresa del extranjero. Es entonces cuando Alfredo se da cuenta de que nunca ha conquistado realmente su corazón. A pesar del dolor, decide dejarla ir, sabiendo que ella merece un amor con Omar. Para cortar sus lazos por completo y asegurarse de que Iris le pertenezca por completo a Omar, Alfredo finge su propia muerte y desaparece en el extranjero. ","chapterCount":60,"labels":["Winning Him Back","Love Triangle"],"tags":["Winning Him Back","Love Triangle"],"typeTwoIds":[321],"typeTwoNames":["Traición"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":321,"name":"Traición","replaceName":"traición"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Traición","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Cuando-el-Amor-es-una-Apuesta-Perdida-Doblado","bookNameLower":"cuando-el-amor-es-una-apuesta-perdida-doblado","shelfTime":"2026-07-15 10:00:01","firstShelfTime":"2026-07-15 10:00:01","performerList":[{"performerId":"20513","performerName":"Wenzhuo Lu","performerFormatName":"Wenzhuo-Lu","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/3x1/20513/20513.jpg?time=1788919006884","videoCount":4},{"performerId":"21001","performerName":"Yuxiu Chen","performerFormatName":"Yuxiu-Chen","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/1x0/21001/21001.jpg?time=1788864768338","videoCount":11}],"performerIdList":[20513,21001]},"chapterList":[{"id":"701288746","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/64/9x2/92x7/927x0/92702000024/701288746_1/701288746.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795222800&Signature=X8o-2UIZgkKdJ2NellUq5iw6glVKhUID~KgMIBVBRXszbnVNG61qixjz6IQH9iOjwxxQQC0UxpVi3Y-AEsG7S9mmtHPuXHNjEcsB-End26ktqJBMVAC7ln5h